3049:
**λογίζομαι**
(λόγος), [in LXX chiefly for חָשַׁב ;] 
1. prop., of numerical calculation, **to count, reckon**: with accusative before μετά, [[41-mark.15.23|Mrk.15:23]] (LXX) (Rec., R, mg.), [[42-luke.22.37|Luk.22:37.]] 
2. Metaphorical, without reference to numbers, by a reckoning of characteristics or reasons; 
(a) **to reckon, take into account**: with accusative of thing(s), [[46-1-corinthians.13.5|1Co.13:5;]] id. before dative of person(s), [[45-romans.4.3|Rom.4:3]] (LXX), [[45-romans.4.4|Rom.4:4, 6 4:8]]" (LXX), [[47-2-corinthians.5.19|2Co.5:19]], [[55-2-timothy.4.16|2Ti.4:16]]; before εἰς (cf. _Heb._ ל חָשַׁב; Bl., § 33, 3), [[44-acts.19.27|Act.19:27]], [[45-romans.2.26|Rom.2:26 4:3, 5 4:9-11, 22-24 9:8]] [[48-galatians.3.6|Gal.3:6]]" (LXX), [[59-james.2.23|Jas.2:23]] (LXX); 
(b) **to consider, calculate**: with accusative of thing(s), [[50-philippians.4.8|Php.4:8;]] before ὅτι, [[43-john.11.50|Jhn.11:50]], [[58-hebrews.11.10|Heb.11:10]]; τοῦτο, ὅτι, [[47-2-corinthians.10.11|2Co.10:11;]] with accusative of person(s), with inf., [[45-romans.6.11|Rom.6:11;]] before ὡς, [[45-romans.8.36|Rom.8:36]] (LXX); 
(with) **to suppose, judge, deem**: [[46-1-corinthians.13.11|1Co.13:11;]] ὡς, [[60-1-peter.5.12|1Pe.5:12;]] οὕτως, [[46-1-corinthians.4.1|1Co.4:1;]] with accusative of thing(s), [[47-2-corinthians.3.5|2Co.3:5;]] id. before εἰς, [[47-2-corinthians.12.6|2Co.12:6;]] ὅτι, [[45-romans.8.18|Rom.8:18;]] τοῦτο, ὅτι, [[45-romans.2.3|Rom.2:3]], [[47-2-corinthians.10.7|2Co.10:7]]; with inf., [[47-2-corinthians.11.5|2Co.11:5;]] accusative and inf., [[45-romans.3.28|Rom.3:28 14:14]], [[50-philippians.3.13|Php.3:13]]; with accusative of person(s) before ὡς, [[47-2-corinthians.10.2|2Co.10:2;]] 
(d) **to purpose, decide**: with inf. (Eur., Or., 555), [[47-2-corinthians.10.2|2Co.10:2]] 
(cf. ἀνα-, δια-, παρα-, συλ-λογίζομαι).
(AS)

3120:
