(AS)

3487:
**νάρδος**, -ου, ἡ
(Heb. נֵרְדְּ, both from Sanscrit narda, see Boisacq, see word), [in LXX: [[22-song-of-songs.1.12|Sng.1:12 4:13-14]] (נֵרְדְּ)* ;] 
