(b) **in answer to the question "whither?" **(= quo): [[40-matthew.28.16|Mat.28:16]], [[42-luke.10.1|Luk.10:1 24:28]]; before ἐάν, with subjc., [[46-1-corinthians.16.6|1Co.16:6.]]
(AS)

3778:
**οὗτος**, αὕτη, τοῦτο, genitive, τούτου, ταύτης, τούτου, 
[in LXX chiefly for זֹאת ,זֶה ;] 
_demonstr. pron._ (related to ἐκεῖνος as _hic to ille), _ 
